  "description": {
   "en": "A superpowered precious little sister is going on an errand for the first time. Her big brother is worried and can't sit still… Will he be able to watch over her safely until the end without being found out? This is a laidback superpower comedy about a brother and sister.\n___\n**Buy:**\n- [Melonbooks](https://www.melonbooks.co.jp/detail/detail.php?product_id=2089782)\n- [Suruga-ya](https://www.suruga-ya.jp/product/detail/ZHORO80935)",
   "ja": "超能力を持つ大切な妹が初めてのおつかいに行く事に。\nお兄ちゃんは心配でいてもたってもいられず…\n最後までバレずに無事見守る事ができるのか?\nそんな兄と妹の、のんびり超能力コメディです。"
  },
